rgo surgical intervention for TOS are able to return to play at the MLB level. With regards to performance, the majority of metrics were unchanged from prior to surgery, indicating return at a similar functional level. DOI: 10.1080/00913847.2021.1880251 PMID: 33472488 [Indexed for MEDLINE]

